Add pinia@^2.1.0 to common-ui, auth, workspace, and admin packages.
Create three composition-API Pinia stores (user.ts, experiment.ts,
webComponents.ts) and supporting types (types/user.ts, types/experiment.ts)
under django_airavata/static/common/js/. Register Pinia via the shared
entry.js factory so all Vue apps pick it up automatically. Vuex modules
remain untouched; consumer migration is M4.
