Rewrites all 34 .vue files in django_airavata/static/common/js/components/
from Options API to <script setup lang="ts">. VModelMixin inlined into
SharedEntityEditor, ConfirmationDialog exposes show/hide via defineExpose,
Linkify retains render-function pattern with a stub <script setup> block.

Also installs @typescript-eslint/parser in tooling and wires it into
the vue-eslint-parser config so <script lang="ts"> blocks parse correctly,
and adds bootstrap + session to the env.d.ts ambient module declarations.
